{"id":"n15966-2-10","stage":2,"title":"결론 · 结论","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15966-2-10-1","ko":"회의 끝났나 보네. 어떻게 결론이 났어?","zh":"会议好像结束了。最后是怎么决定的？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회의","meaning":"会，会议","explanation":"회의：会，会议。","readings":[{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73244","senseId":"1","lemma":"회의","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회의","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3"}},{"text":"끝났나","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끝났나","audio":"/audio/91f062a34b122d75513e.mp3"}},{"text":"보네.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보네","audio":"/audio/96524ba9d0f7019fa440.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"결론이","meaning":"结论","explanation":"결론：结论；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"결론","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15966","senseId":"2","lemma":"결론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결론이","audio":"/audio/d735143350b0460230f4.mp3"}},{"text":"났어?","meaning":"形成、得出（结论）","explanation":"결론이 나다：得出结论、作出决定；나다 在搭配中表示结论形成。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"났어","audio":"/audio/a44d1f8862eee3132ce7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8ada2d6d6aa420fc","term":"회의","zh":"会，会议","audio":"/audio/8ada2d6d6aa420fc4f0d.mp3","entryId":"73244","definition":"许多人聚在一起讨论；或指这种聚会。","pronunciation":["회ː의","훼ː이"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"ce5da34183dc53ab","term":"결론","zh":"结论","audio":"/audio/ce5da34183dc53ab86fe.mp3","entryId":"15966","definition":"对某个问题最后下的判断。","pronunciation":["결론"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"形成、得出（结论）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"形成、得出（结论）","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/004f04e83ff23010333b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15966-2-10-2","ko":"이전에 세운 계획을 모두 바꾸기로 했어요.","zh":"我们决定把之前制定的所有计划都改掉。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이전에","meaning":"以前，之前","explanation":"이전：以前，之前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이전","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70752","senseId":"1","lemma":"이전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이전에","audio":"/audio/4f422eb4e4b9519f0146.mp3"}},{"text":"세운","meaning":"制定，决定","explanation":"세우다：制定，决定；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"세우다","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58163","senseId":"4","lemma":"세우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세운","audio":"/audio/327d5f4fbd7658ca4c36.mp3"}},{"text":"계획을","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획을","audio":"/audio/5a4419ddd6a675f50d9e.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有。","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"바꾸기로","meaning":"改变，转变，更改","explanation":"바꾸다：改变，转变，更改；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"바꾸다","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17198","senseId":"2","lemma":"바꾸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바꾸기로","audio":"/audio/4922ad17f6e988a6143c.mp3"}},{"text":"했어요.","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했어요","audio":"/audio/767a8404e5a0794daaf5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da7e61c67cc5a90f","term":"이전","zh":"以前，之前","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3","entryId":"70752","definition":"比现在往前。","pronunciation":["이ː전"]},{"id":"23575e84cdfb112c","term":"세우다","zh":"制定，决定","audio":"/audio/23575e84cdfb112c017e.mp3","entryId":"58163","definition":"确定计划或决心。","pronunciation":["세우다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"5cc3393b01c955d1","term":"바꾸다","zh":"改变，转变，更改","audio":"/audio/5cc3393b01c955d1c3fb.mp3","entryId":"17198","definition":"改动原有的内容或状态。","pronunciation":["바꾸다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3e77d6b6f25bed0ff8e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.608,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15966","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":82,"sequenceScore":2.2614,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们决定把之前制定的所有计划都改掉。","会议好像结束了。最后是怎么决定的？","学期快结束了，对学习的热情也越来越低了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["会议好像结束了。最后是怎么决定的？","学期快结束了，对学习的热情也越来越低了。","我们决定把之前制定的所有计划都改掉。"],"answer":2}]}
